From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openEuler RISC-V Package Automation <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libsent: include OpenMP declarations whenever enabled

calc_dnn.c calls OpenMP runtime functions whenever the compiler defines
_OPENMP, including on targets without an enabled SIMD implementation.  The
omp.h include was incorrectly nested inside the SIMD feature conditional, so
non-SIMD targets compiled those calls without declarations.  Include omp.h
whenever OpenMP is enabled while leaving SIMD selection unchanged.

Patch-Source: openEuler RISC-V package CI failure analysis
Patch-License: BSD-3-Clause
Upstream-Status: Not Submitted (automated upstream writes are not authorized)
Remove-When: Upstream includes omp.h whenever _OPENMP is defined in a stable release.
---
 libsent/src/phmm/calc_dnn.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libsent/src/phmm/calc_dnn.c b/libsent/src/phmm/calc_dnn.c
--- a/libsent/src/phmm/calc_dnn.c
+++ b/libsent/src/phmm/calc_dnn.c
@@ -21,11 +21,12 @@
 #include <sent/hmm.h>
 #include <sent/hmm_calc.h>
 
-#if defined(HAS_SIMD_FMA) || defined(HAS_SIMD_AVX) || defined(HAS_SIMD_SSE) || defined(HAS_SIMD_NEON) || defined(HAS_SIMD_NEONV2)
-#define SIMD_ENABLED
 #ifdef _OPENMP
 #include <omp.h>
 #endif /* _OPENMP */
+
+#if defined(HAS_SIMD_FMA) || defined(HAS_SIMD_AVX) || defined(HAS_SIMD_SSE) || defined(HAS_SIMD_NEON) || defined(HAS_SIMD_NEONV2)
+#define SIMD_ENABLED
 #endif
 
 static int use_simd = USE_SIMD_NONE;
--
2.50.1
